Think: Interpret the raw var value as a canonical numeric form (or record failure) and write result to int_check_workspace/var_numeric.txt.

Act: bash

```bash
awk '{
  s=$0
  gsub(/^[ \t\r\n]+|[ \t\r\n]+$/,"",s)
  if(s==""){ print "ERROR: empty value"; exit }
  if (s ~ /^[+-]?([0-9]+(\.[0-9]*)?|\.[0-9]+)([eE][+-]?[0-9]+)?$/) {
    num = s + 0
    printf "%.15g\n", num
  } else {
    print "ERROR: not a numeric value: " s
  }
}' int_check_workspace/var_raw.txt > int_check_workspace/var_numeric.txt
```

